<p>understand Erdős--Rényi networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize expected degree;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand degree distributions in random graphs;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize giant-component transitions conceptually;</p>
</li>
