</li>
<li>
<p>understand coupled dynamical systems on networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize network controllability conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand flow networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize shortest paths and routing;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand maximum flow and minimum cut conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize transportation and communication networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand social-network modeling;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize biological networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand ecological networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize financial networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand infrastructure networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize dependency networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand network inference from data;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize missing and uncertain edges;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand link prediction conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize network sampling bias;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand null models;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize network motifs;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand motif significance conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize network entropy conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand dynamical processes on networks;</p>
</li>
<li>
